The plate is a square side plate, roughly 20 cm across, holding about 8 strips of cooked bacon, some of them broken pieces.

Cooked crispy bacon weighs about 8 g per strip, so 8 strips come to roughly 60 g, allowing for a few larger strips. Cooked bacon runs about 540 kcal per 100 g, which gives about 325 kcal for 60 g. The strips look thin and well done, so I'm lowering the weight to about 45 g, or about 240 kcal.

